<h1>{{if eq .change "recovery_regenerated"}}Recovery codes replaced{{else if eq .change "passkey_added"}}Passkey added{{else if eq .change "passkey_removed"}}Passkey removed{{else}}Two-step verification {{if eq .change "enabled"}}turned on{{else if eq .change "disabled"}}turned off{{else if eq .change "enforced"}}is now required{{else if eq .change "reset"}}was reset{{else}}changed{{end}}{{end}}</h1>
<p>Hello <strong>{{.name}}</strong>,</p>
<p>{{if eq .change "enabled"}}Two-step verification was turned on for your account.{{else if eq .change "disabled"}}Two-step verification was turned off for your account.{{else if eq .change "enforced"}}Your administrator now requires two-step verification for your account.{{else if eq .change "reset"}}Your administrator reset two-step verification. Set it up again at your next sign-in.{{else if eq .change "recovery_regenerated"}}New recovery codes were generated for your account. The old ones no longer work.{{else if eq .change "passkey_added"}}A passkey was added to your account. You can now sign in with it.{{else if eq .change "passkey_removed"}}A passkey was removed from your account.{{else}}Two-step verification on your account changed: {{.change}}.{{end}}</p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 0;"><tr><td style="background:#f9fafb;border-left:3px solid #d1d5db;border-radius:4px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#4b5563;">If this was not you, contact your administrator.</td></tr></table>
